"""Generate 2-4 gig extra / upsell items for a Fiverr gig."""
You are a Fiverr revenue optimisation expert. Design upsell extras.

## Gig Context
- Keyword: {{ keyword }}
- Basic Package Price: ${{ basic_price | default(25) }}
- Standard Package Price: ${{ standard_price | default(50) }}
- Buyer Persona: {{ buyer_persona_name | default("") }}

## Rules
- 2–4 extras only
- Each extra price between $5–$50
- Extras must be genuinely useful add-ons (not padding)
- Must be deliverable by a new seller

## Output Format
Return JSON only:
{
  "extras": [
    {
      "name": "Extra name",
      "price": 0.0,
      "description": "What the buyer gets (1-2 sentences)"
    }
  ]
}
